 <title>Symfony en Drupal 8. Los detalles..</title>
 <link>http://2012.drupalcamp.es/en/node/101</link>
 <description>  &lt;span class=&quot;field-label&quot;&gt;
    Audiencia:
  &lt;/span&gt;

&lt;ul class=&quot;field-session-audience inline&quot;&gt;

